Frontend adapted from wcbspp/padavan-shellcrash-panel (GPL-3.0-only).
The unmodified ShellCrash 1.9.4release archive is redistributed in vendor/ with its upstream license and source metadata. AX5 patches are distributed separately and preserve upstream copyright headers. Source: https://github.com/juewuy/ShellCrash
Entware script adaptation originates from monlor/MIXBOX-ARCHIVE / monlor/mbfiles (GPL-3.0); original copyright headers are retained.
CN IPv4 seed originated from the Padavan china-IP rule table. cn.srs and cn.mrs are public CN domain datasets distributed by the ShellCrash tool; upstream rules source: https://github.com/juewuy/ShellCrash/tree/dev/rules . Their original licenses remain applicable; they are not runtime user configurations.
Kernel archives are not bundled. The installer downloads the unmodified ShellCrash ARMv7 sing-box mini 1.12.13 build with a fixed source and SHA256; component licenses remain applicable.
Private configurations, passwords, device identities and SSH keys are excluded.
